TITLE:: RCBeatSpec
summary:: A prepared beat: everything needed to start it, without starting
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCBeat, Classes/RCOsc

DESCRIPTION::
The proto-library returned "a function that starts the pattern when calling .value"; an RCBeatSpec is that function as an object. link::Classes/RCOsc#-startDefs:: makes kill / pause / resume / start OSC defs for it.

